comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T12:25:46.741Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status GH-1328 and test-result-tracking searches found the closed tracking feature pm-16f4 and its parent epic but no open owner for the false recording receipt."
  "2026-09-27T23:32:21.975Z","harness:codex","Verification: linked test-command suite 63/63 passed and recorded a durable test_run_track receipt. Manual isolated tracker runs confirmed enabled=true records history, disabled=false reports tracking_disabled and changed=false, and simulated write failure reports write_failed without claiming persistence. Exact full coverage passed 9380 tests at 100/100/100/100. Hosted review remains pending."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T21:41:13.799Z","harness:codex","Temporary acceptance: PM_PATH and PM_GLOBAL_PATH pointed to a disposable initialized workspace. A passing linked node command with tracking disabled returned recorded=false, reason=tracking_disabled, changed=false; enabling project tracking then returned recorded=true, changed=true and an immutable test_run_track event."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T21:41:15.542Z","harness:codex",A successful process exit and a durable item evidence write are separate outcomes. Return an explicit receipt and mark changed only after append succeeds; measurement history must read persisted runs only.
